ent-MisfitsBannerChildrenOfAtom = Flag of the Children of Atom
    .desc = The banner of the Children of Atom cult. They believe that radiation is a gift that will help its followers ascend, as it transforms the land and the life within it.
ent-MisfitsDecorationFlagChildrenOfAtom = Flag of the Children of Atom
    .desc = The banner of the Children of Atom, it proudly stands against a world that would refuse the teachings of its acolytes. Where this flag is planted, so too will come the gift of Atom's radiant glow.
